    <h2>8. Business &amp; Technology Integration</h2>
    <p>
      India is a global powerhouse for information technology, software outsourcing, and customer service. 
      Managing business operations across the 5.5-hour offset requires clear scheduling rules and robust systems:
    </p>

    <!-- Visual Asset 5: India Business Hours Timeline -->
    <figure style="margin: 2.5rem 0; text-align: center; border: 1px solid var(--line); padding: 1.5rem; border-radius: 12px; background: var(--panel);">
      <img 
