    <h2>9. Travel &amp; Daily Life in India</h2>
    <p>
      Traveling across India involves navigating its vast geography without ever changing your watch. 
      However, the physical solar difference means daily routines vary significantly between states:
    </p>

    <!-- Visual Asset 10: India Time Throughout the Day Timeline -->
    <figure style="margin: 2.5rem 0; text-align: center; border: 1px solid var(--line); padding: 1.5rem; border-radius: 12px; background: var(--panel);">
